# Gamer Nexus - Fullstack Ecommerce Web App

**Gamer Nexus** is a full-featured, modern ecommerce website for gamers. It aggregates gaming hardware from eBay and PC game data from Steam to create a curated hub for gamers to browse gear and deals. This project is built as a **personal portfolio project** and demonstrates fullstack development, API integration, CI/CD, and cloud deployment.

---

## 🚀 Tech Stack

### Frontend
- **Vite** (React)
- **Tailwind CSS** (via `@tailwindcss/vite` plugin)
- React Hooks + React Router
- Framer Motion for animations
- Neon Cyberpunk design theme

### Backend
- **Flask** (Python 3.11+)
- REST API endpoints for products, games, search, and wishlist
- PostgreSQL for user/wishlist data
- Redis caching for API responses

### APIs
- [eBay Browse API](https://developer.ebay.com/api-docs/buy/browse/overview.html)
- [Steam Web / Store API](https://partner.steamgames.com/doc/webapi_overview)

### DevOps / Deployment
- **GitHub Actions** for CI/CD
- Docker + Docker Compose for containerized deployment
- Oracle Cloud Free Tier (VM / Kubernetes)

---

## 🏗 Project Structure

```
ecommerce-gamer-store/
├── frontend/         # Vite + React + Tailwind
│   ├── src/
│   ├── index.html
│   └── package.json
├── backend/          # Flask API
│   ├── app.py
│   ├── routes/
│   ├── services/
│   └── requirements.txt
├── .github/
│   └── workflows/    # GitHub Actions CI/CD
├── docker-compose.yml
└── README.md
```

---

## ⚡ Features

### Frontend
- Neon cyberpunk UI for gamer aesthetic
- Home page with featured eBay products & Steam deals
- Game + gear search
- Hover/tilt product cards & modals with Framer Motion

### Backend
- `/products` → fetch eBay products
- `/games` → fetch Steam game info
- `/wishlist` → save user favorite items
- `/auth` → optional JWT login/signup

### Dev
- Linting and testing via GitHub Actions
- Automatic deployment to Oracle VM on merge to main

---

## 🛠 Setup & Installation

### Prerequisites
- Node.js 20+
- Python 3.11+
- npm / pip
- Docker (optional for deployment)

### Clone Repo
```powershell
git clone https://github.com/YOUR_USERNAME/ecommerce-gamer-store.git
cd ecommerce-gamer-store
```

### Frontend
```powershell
cd frontend
npm install
npm run dev
```

### Backend
```powershell
cd backend
python -m venv venv
.\venv\Scripts\activate   # Windows
pip install -r requirements.txt
flask run
```

---

## 📦 Environment Variables

### Backend `.env`
```
SECRET_KEY=supersecret
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://user:password@localhost:5432/dbname
EBAY_API_KEY=your-ebay-key
STEAM_API_KEY=your-steam-key
```

### Frontend `.env`
```
VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:5000/api
```

